\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-cuba-melia-cayo-guillermo-pro-pic-teasers-alain-doss-photography-46525\/\">Miranda's Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-pro-ttd-teaser-pics-alain-doss-photography-46528\/\">Miranda's Pro TTD Pics<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"miranda.lightstone@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1214110002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210089.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BlissfulMsMiranda","Id":210089,"Name":"BlissfulMsMiranda","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33385,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0c15396c6dc2515bfded13d2af18d55","RawContent":"Alright, for all you girls considering ordering from WeddingTutu.com here&#039;s what mine looks like IRL. :) It came a few weeks ago, but I was waiting to get my flower girl in it before I posted about it: \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img214.imageshack.us\/img214\/7625\/sissi.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img214.imageshack.us\/img214\/1708\/sissidress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n The color is turquoise (looks darker in real life ... stupid flash) and she is 7 yrs old, so I got the 17&amp;quot; length skirt and the XL leotard. Everything fits perfectly. \n \n And for you CDN brides, it cost me $126 total, shipped, for both items and it took about 2 1\/2 - 3 weeks for the order I think ... I don&#039;t quite remember now though. Closer to 2 weeks than 3 though! She&#039;s adorable and I can&#039;t wait to see her on the beach in this!!","Attachments":[],"Id":629841,"PostDate":1237851072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Alright, for all you girls considering ordering from WeddingTutu.com here's what mine looks like IRL. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> It came a few weeks ago, but I was waiting to get my flower girl in it before I posted about it: <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img214.imageshack.us\/img214\/7625\/sissi.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img214.imageshack.us\/img214\/1708\/sissidress.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> The color is turquoise (looks darker in real life ... stupid flash) and she is 7 yrs old, so I got the 17\" length skirt and the XL leotard. Everything fits perfectly. <br \/> <br \/> And for you CDN brides, it cost me $126 total, shipped, for both items and it took about 2 1\/2 - 3 weeks for the order I think ... I don't quite remember now though. Closer to 2 weeks than 3 though! She's adorable and I can't wait to see her on the beach in this!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i>Automotive Journalist Extraordinaire<\/i><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/drivingmsmiranda.wordpress.com\/\">Driving MsMiranda's Blog<\/a><\/strong><br><br><br><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/blissfulmsmirandas-mirandas-planning-madness-pic-heavy-42210\/\">Miranda's Planning Thread ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f55\/my-montreal-bd-shoot-pics-41285\/\">Miranda's BD Shoot<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-non-pro-melia-cayo-guillermo-wedding-ttd-pics-43309\/\">~~ Miranda's Non-Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-cuba-melia-cayo-guillermo-pro-pic-teasers-alain-doss-photography-46525\/\">Miranda's Pro Pics ~~<\/a><\/strong><span> <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f76\/mirandas-pro-ttd-teaser-pics-alain-doss-photography-46528\/\">Miranda's Pro TTD Pics<\/a><\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"miranda.lightstone@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1214110002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210089.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"BlissfulMsMiranda","Id":210089,"Name":"BlissfulMsMiranda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33385,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"Tot