wel! I&#039;m still trying to figure out how to post pictures on the site - but I have posted links to my Flickr account\n \n Here is a picture of it as a bag: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/52635676@N00\/4096661300\/\"&gt;bag - closed on Flickr - Photo Sharing!&lt;\/a&gt; \n \n This picture is harder to see - but it is opened as a towel: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/52635676@N00\/4095901791\/in\/photostream\/\"&gt;bag - open on Flickr - Photo Sharing!&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n Now I just have to make 40 more AND figure out what I&#039;m going to put in the bags! I bought the pattern off of Etsy - so if anyone wants it, I&#039;m happy to send you the seller&#039;s information.","Attachments":[],"Id":921609,"PostDate":1257998747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have only finished 8 of my OOT bags but I'm really excited. I am making them out of beach towels - and they open up into a full size towel! I'm still trying to figure out how to post pictures on the site - but I have posted links to my Flickr account<br \/> <br \/> Here is a picture of it as a bag: <a href='http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/52635676@N00\/4096661300\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>bag - closed on Flickr - Photo Sharing!<\/a> <br \/> <br \/> This picture is harder to see - but it is opened as a towel: <a href='http:\/\/www.flickr.com\/photos\/52635676@N00\/4095901791\/in\/photostream\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>bag - open on Flickr - Photo Sharing!<\/a><br \/> <br \/> Now I just have to make 40 more AND figure out what I'm going to put in the bags! I bought the pattern off of Etsy - so if anyone wants it, I'm happy to send you the seller's information.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_loveman@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252203748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221343.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marne","Id":221343,"Name":"Marne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44945,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f207118d0b53afba8591780525b3c0f","RawContent":"Very cool idea!!","Attachments":[],"Id":921669,"PostDate":1258000706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Very cool idea!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristaheer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1237224321,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215852.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krista_H","Id":215852,"Name":"Krista_H","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44945,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3144ec9a4afde4506b0cbef7393954eb","RawContent":"Very good idea, and they look really nice! Did it take a lot of time to sew?","Attachments":[],"Id":921679,"PostDate":1258000970,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Very good idea, and they look really nice! Did it take a lot of time to sew?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smumau@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1247970279,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219571.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sweetiecat","Id":219571,"Name":"sweetiecat","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44945,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51bf44ea493ff613d4550a9f53f77641","RawContent":"Ok - I did my homework and can post pictures now.\n \n Closed - as a bag\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i679.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv157\/m_loveman\/bag-closed.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Open - as a towel\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i679.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv157\/m_loveman\/bag-open.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I also got towels in brown and blue - and brown and pink. The only problem is, they&#039;re kind of cheap. Because I needed to purchase 96 towels, I didn&#039;t want to spend a ton of money. I think each one was about $5 - which means that they&#039;re pretty thin. I still think my guests are going to love them.","Attachments":[],"Id":921684,"PostDate":1258001038,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok - I did my homework and can post pictures now.<br \/> <br \/> Closed - as a bag<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i679.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv157\/m_loveman\/bag-closed.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Open - as a towel<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i679.photobucket.com\/albums\/vv157\/m_loveman\/bag-open.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I also got towels in brown and blue - and brown and pink. The only problem is, they're kind of cheap. Because I needed to purchase 96 towels, I didn't want to spend a ton of money. I think each one was about $5 - which means that they're pretty thin. I still think my guests are going to love them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_loveman@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252203748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221343.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Marne","Id":221343,"Name":"Marne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":44945,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c89e5ba63023ef964b401ac6e90200f","RawContent":"They are somewhat time consuming but worth it. I made my own little assembly line. First I cut all the pieces, then I sewed all the straps - and then the rest of the bag. I put my fiance to work as the thread cutter. I would say each bag probably takes an hour, start to finish.","Attachments":[],"Id":921694,"PostDate":1258001183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                They are somewhat time consuming but worth it. I made my own little assembly line. First I cut all the pieces, then I sewed all the straps - and then the rest of the bag. I put my fiance to work as the thread cutter. I would say each bag probably takes an hour, start to finish.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m_loveman@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1252203748,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"ht