having or have had their wedding on the Carnival Sensation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Question: When you booked your room, what room did you book?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1511213,"PostDate":1314320591,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> Just wanted to open a thread for those who are having or have had their wedding on the Carnival Sensation.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Question: When you booked your room, what room did you book?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312169137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a6eb99820e4f42759ccb9e13a3cefbc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am planning my vow renewal for 2013 (5th Anniversary) and I am cruising the Sensation in December to get a feel for it. It&#039;s affordable for my guests especially since most are coming from the north. I can&#039;t wait to see some responses as well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1511374,"PostDate":1314364893,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am planning my vow renewal for 2013 (5th Anniversary) and I am cruising the Sensation in December to get a feel for it. It's affordable for my guests especially since most are coming from the north. I can't wait to see some responses as well.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.Perfect-Breeze.com\">www.Perfect-Breeze.com<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrs.mack-jones@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1179896003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":157,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RiuBride2b","Id":207417,"Name":"RiuBride2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b04101ee023a0377c2b7e040df1d74f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Also, I read quite a few reviews on cruisecritic.com. Have you tried that resource?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1511376,"PostDate":1314365115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Also, I read quite a few reviews on cruisecritic.com. Have you tried that resource?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.Perfect-Breeze.com\">www.Perfect-Breeze.com<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrs.mack-jones@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1179896003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":157,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RiuBride2b","Id":207417,"Name":"RiuBride2b","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43741bc9fe92d1647bebf31b0d8ca178","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am also getting married on the Carnival Sensation! It actually looks as though we will be on the same cruise! Our wedding is on Sunday, May 6th, 2012!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have had some trouble finding wedding reviews for the Sensation, but the people at Carnival have been great so far!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Ashley&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1549868,"PostDate":1322021956,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am also getting married on the Carnival Sensation! It actually looks as though we will be on the same cruise! Our wedding is on Sunday, May 6th, 2012!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have had some trouble finding wedding reviews for the Sensation, but the people at Carnival have been great so far!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Ashley<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley.whitehorne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1322021716,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247962.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyW334","Id":247962,"Name":"AshleyW334","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a10af5d04af26120017bb1ea43871a8c","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kks2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello Ladies, \n Just wanted to open a thread for those who are having or have had their wedding on the Carnival Sensation.  \n \n Question: When you booked your room, what room did you book?[\/quote] \n \n \n I&#039;m not cruising on the Sensation, but I&#039;m on the Paradise which is essentially the same ship...  we booked a grand suite, so that we would have the balcony, a tub, and the extra room to get ready on the wedding day. I think our exact room number is U90, right in the middle of the ship on the upper deck.  Our parents and some other immediate family members all booked junior suites, and everyone else is in inside cabins, I believe. \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AshleyW334[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello! \n \n I am also getting married on the Carnival Sensation! It actually looks as though we will be on the same cruise! Our wedding is on Sunday, May 6th, 2012! \n \n I have had some trouble finding wedding reviews for the Sensation, but the people at Carnival have been great so far! \n \n -Ashley[\/quote] \n \n \n I just had to reply to you... we&#039;re like almost twins! [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif[\/img]  We&#039;re both Ashley W and our weddings are so close, haha.. mine is May 5th!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1552249,"PostDate":1322689108,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kks2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> Just wanted to open a thread for those who are having or have had their wedding on the Carnival Sensation.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Question: When you booked your room, what room did you book?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I'm not cruising on the Sensation, but I'm on the Paradise which is essentially the same ship...\u00a0 we booked a grand suite, so that we would have the balcony, a tub, and the extra room to get ready on the wedding day. I think our exact room number is U90, right in the middle of the ship on the upper deck.\u00a0 Our parents and some other immediate family members all booked junior suites, and everyone else is in inside cabins, I believe.<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AshleyW334<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am also getting married on the Carnival Sensation! It actually looks as though we will be on the same cruise! Our wedding is on Sunday, May 6th, 2012!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have had some trouble finding wedding reviews for the Sensation, but the people at Carnival have been great so far!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Ashley<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I just had to reply to you... we're like almost twins! <span alt=\";)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_7_1322688692434_160\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/wink.gif\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 We're both Ashley W and our weddings are so close, haha.. mine is May 5th!! <\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><strong>Ashley & Zac<\/strong><span> - May 5, 2012 aboard the Carnival Paradise<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>30 sailing guests + 2 non-sailing guests<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.fieldswedding.com\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:10px;\">www.fieldswedding.com<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashley.walztoni@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1270758659,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227160.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AshleyW","Id":227160,"Name":"AshleyW","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"78e0f9954e980ca16929cb903995bac7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Finally found some other Sensation brides!!&amp;nbsp; I am getting married on 4\/15\/2012. It is coming up so quick! I just got the final details and where is ceramony and reception are going to be held. I am hopeing that everything goes smoothe. I am starting to get nervous!&amp;nbsp; &lt;span alt=\":-\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1333841264531_157\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1604942,"PostDate":1333841622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Finally found some other Sensation brides!!\u00a0 I am getting married on 4\/15\/2012. It is coming up so quick! I just got the final details and where is ceramony and reception are going to be held. I am hopeing that everything goes smoothe. I am starting to get nervous!\u00a0 <span alt=\":-\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1333841264531_157\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/undecided.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deadseriousparanormal@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333840582,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253720.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"parabuff","Id":253720,"Name":"parabuff","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa84d746c458618d0cb8f56d2f892da4","RawContent":"Where on the ship are you getting married. Time is going by so quickly!","Attachments":[],"Id":1605186,"PostDate":1333931147,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Where on the ship are you getting married. Time is going by so quickly!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312169137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0e8dc66bd4c01d5337485e00b46149b","RawContent":"I&#039;m a little disappointed. They changed the time we leave Nassau from 5 am on may 9 to 5pm on may 8. This puts a monkey wrench in my plans to party on the shore that evening :(","Attachments":[],"Id":1612548,"PostDate":1335525501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm a little disappointed. They changed the time we leave Nassau from 5 am on may 9 to 5pm on may 8. This puts a monkey wrench in my plans to party on the shore that evening <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","Join