nyone here heard of the cruise ship called &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.blountsmallshipadventures.com\/&#039;&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;Blount Small Ship Cruise Adventures&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;\"&gt;? It is a small cruise ship (focuses mainly on river cruises). They cover various travel destinations around the USA and Canada. I am thinking of booking a trip to Belize next month. If any one have traveled in this ship please do share your experiences. Thanks!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1873910,"PostDate":1412151545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial\">Have anyone here heard of the cruise ship called <\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.blountsmallshipadventures.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Blount Small Ship Cruise Adventures<\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-size:15px;font-family:Arial\">? It is a small cruise ship (focuses mainly on river cruises). They cover various travel destinations around the USA and Canada. I am thinking of booking a trip to Belize next month. If any one have traveled in this ship please do share your experiences. Thanks!<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christinapvavra@dayrep.com","IpAddress":"184.75.217.227","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412151394,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ChristiCGreen","Id":280159,"Name":"ChristiCGreen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78127,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"878f221b718243114a267c6e5ed09405","RawContent":"I am pretty cruise obsessed, and am often on the cruise blogs...and I&#039;ve never heard of it!\n[quote name=\"ChristiCGreen\" post=\"1873910\" timestamp=\"1412151545\"]\n[font=Arial]Have anyone here heard of the cruise ship called [\/size][\/font][url=\"http:\/\/www.blountsmallshipadventures.com\/\"][color=#222222][font=Arial]Blount Small Ship Cruise Adventures[\/size][\/font][\/color][\/url][font=Arial]? It is a small cruise ship (focuses mainly on river cruises). They cover various travel destinations around the USA and Canada. I am thinking of booking a trip to Belize next month. If any one have traveled in this ship please do share your experiences. Thanks![\/size][\/font][\/quote]Belize is beautiful though!","Attachments":[],"Id":1874404,"PostDate":1412570080,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am pretty cruise obsessed, and am often on the cruise blogs...and I've never heard of it!<br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ChristiCGreen, on 01 October 2014 - 12:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\">Have anyone here heard of the cruise ship called [\/size]<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.blountsmallshipadventures.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"color:#222222\"><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\">Blount Small Ship Cruise Adventures[\/size]<\/span><\/span><\/a><span  style=\"font-family:Arial\">? It is a small cruise ship (focuses mainly on river cruises). They cover various travel destinations around the USA and Canada. I am thinking of booking a trip to Belize next month. If any one have traveled in this ship please do share your experiences. Thanks![\/size]<\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nBelize is beautiful though! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cathyr99@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"107.201.33.67","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1412566251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280304.jpg?_r=1412569727","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":281,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"palmtree99","Id":280304,"Name":"palmtree99","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78127","Title":"Have Anyone Here Heard Of This Cruise Ship?","LastPostDate":1412570080},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
