> User Alyne (284799)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":18,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":3831,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1551155,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":246301,"Name":"okmyers","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246301.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1322450433,"LastPoster":{"Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":88,"Preview":{"Id":1869651,"PostDate":1409276972,"PostContent":"I Lov the bag idea","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tammy.jacobs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.211.99.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405957765,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279107.jpg?_r=1408932832","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"projecttwayne2015","Id":279107,"Name":"projecttwayne2015","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bfe76ae44d9eee53e01dc7bbcda9ebd9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Ok Brides and Newleweds....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I need some help. I am getting married aboard the Carnival Conquest in June 2012. I originally wanted to do \"Welcome Aboard\" bags for the 30 or so guest we have sailing with us. BUT when I really started shopping around, I realized how hard it was to create \"special\" bags for women, men, teenagers, and children all the same. I&#039;m starting to think I should have something special made for the women (monogrammed make-up bags) and something special made for men. And something different for the kids. HELP I&#039;m confused and I would love to hear some suggestions!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1551155,"PostDate":1322450433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ok Brides and Newleweds....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I need some help. I am getting married aboard the Carnival Conquest in June 2012. I originally wanted to do \"Welcome Aboard\" bags for the 30 or so guest we have sailing with us. BUT when I really started shopping around, I realized how hard it was to create \"special\" bags for women, men, teenagers, and children all the same. I'm starting to think I should have something special made for the women (monogrammed make-up bags) and something special made for men. And something different for the kids. HELP I'm confused and I would love to hear some suggestions!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"okmyers60@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317913753,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246301.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"okmyers","Id":246301,"Name":"okmyers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2215fb7aaa4094793d7187478195626","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I would look at the thread that has a master list of oot bag contents. If you look in the cruise wedding sections they suggest things like tolietries, motion sickness bands and air freshers. I think someone mentioned putting money on their accounts for drinks and pool toys for the kids. I&#039;m sure you can get mini bottles of alcohol past security, I know on carnival you can bring two bottles of wine per person, so you can give couples wine before they board. You really should try searching though, there&#039;s a lot of threads like this started.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1551639,"PostDate":1322589173,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I would look at the thread that has a master list of oot bag contents. If you look in the cruise wedding sections they suggest things like tolietries, motion sickness bands and air freshers. I think someone mentioned putting money on their accounts for drinks and pool toys for the kids. I'm sure you can get mini bottles of alcohol past security, I know on carnival you can bring two bottles of wine per person, so you can give couples wine before they board. You really should try searching though, there's a lot of threads like this started.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278378904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc99bf99d7d9cb09cc3571690ffb9809","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I like the idea of having something special for each member of the family for each oot bag, but it is alot of work. If you are up to it, I love the make up bag idea for the women, you can do the same for the men just a more masculine travel bag. For the kids depending on ages, maybe younger ones could get a cute bag with goggles and a coloring book and crayons, mid age goggles and cards maybe older could get the bags like the adults.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1552007,"PostDate":1322658965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I like the idea of having something special for each member of the family for each oot bag, but it is alot of work. If you are up to it, I love the make up bag idea for the women, you can do the same for the men just a more masculine travel bag. For the kids depending on ages, maybe younger ones could get a cute bag with goggles and a coloring book and crayons, mid age goggles and cards maybe older could get the bags like the adults.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c_mcstowe@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1322658302,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248191.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bostoncruiser35","Id":248191,"Name":"bostoncruiser35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7be3993955f73fc85c0883095551a6bf","RawContent":"Good Ideas...I bought makeup bag sets from Dollar Tree for my bags, They have a satin finish and different patterns (zebra, leopard, dots, ect) and there is a large and small one. I also got plastic ones with colored zippers and the smaller bag is the same material as the reusable grocery bags. It&#039;s pretty awesome for 2 for a $1. \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]bostoncruiser35[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I like the idea of having something special for each member of the family for each oot bag, but it is alot of work. If you are up to it, I love the make up bag idea for the women, you can do the same for the men just a more masculine travel bag. For the kids depending on ages, maybe younger ones could get a cute bag with goggles and a coloring book and crayons, mid age goggles and cards maybe older could get the bags like the adults.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1552297,"PostDate":1322696401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Good Ideas...I bought makeup bag sets from Dollar Tree for my bags, They have a satin finish and different patterns (zebra, leopard, dots, ect) and there is a large and small one. I also got plastic ones with colored zippers and the smaller bag is the same material as the reusable grocery bags. It's pretty awesome for 2 for a $1.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>bostoncruiser35<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I like the idea of having something special for each member of the family for each oot bag, but it is alot of work. If you are up to it, I love the make up bag idea for the women, you can do the same for the men just a more masculine travel bag. For the kids depending on ages, maybe younger ones could get a cute bag with goggles and a coloring book and crayons, mid age goggles and cards maybe older could get the bags like the adults.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amberdominiquedesigns@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"72.218.108.233","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278378904,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229894.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dominiqueamber","Id":229894,"Name":"dominiqueamber","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e67a2e433a61cf3029d3cb8dd93333f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Welcome aboard and Congratulations on your up coming wedding.&amp;nbsp; I am a Carnival Conquest bride to  on Sept.19 , 2012 offshore on the beach&amp;nbsp;in the Port of Montego Bay. The&amp;nbsp;Reception will be&amp;nbsp;at&amp;nbsp;All-Inclusive hotel called&amp;nbsp;DeCameron. &amp;nbsp; I have so far 35 guest and rising lol.&amp;nbsp; Here are some items that I thought about putting in my bags: a Survival Kit with advil, alkaselzer,altoids, gum or mints, motion sickness meds, pepto bismol , hand sanitizer a sticker that reads In Sickness and In Health on the Meds. Luggage tag with a business card from Vista Print inside with our wedding logo&amp;nbsp;, a key holder to put around their necks with the same cards from Vista Print reading To have and To Hold your sign and sail card. A bag of popcorn with a label that reads Have you had a Poppin&#039; Good Time? Thanks for sharing our special day ! Our names and the Wedding Date.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here&amp;nbsp;are &amp;nbsp;some wordings that you can use for labels for your survival kit&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Too Much Booze (BC,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Too Much Sun ( if you want to put some sunscreen lotion or lip balm)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Too Much Food (pepto, alkerselzer&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Too Much Fun&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I haven&#039;t found a bag yet for them so I might just do a gift bag with my colors and ribbons.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t want to spend much on bags 1.50 is the max and I don&#039;t see any cheaper.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Any ideas Ladies for OOOT bags?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have seen a template for the survival kit on her but I haven&#039;t saved it yet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also I wanted to mention with my Bridesmaids I&#039;m only having 2 their bags will be a little diffent.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m trying to find a straw bag for them and&amp;nbsp;add some sunglasses&amp;nbsp;,&amp;nbsp;Brides Entorouge tank&amp;nbsp;shirt and a passport&amp;nbsp;wallet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I hope that this helped .&amp;nbsp; Let&#039;s keep in touch so that&amp;nbsp;we can compare wedding info for the Carnival Conquest.&amp;nbsp; You can PM me.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1557850,"PostDate":1324149745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Welcome aboard and Congratulations on your up coming wedding.\u00a0 I am a Carnival Conquest bride to\u00a0\u00a0on Sept.19 , 2012 offshore on the beach\u00a0in the Port of Montego Bay. The\u00a0Reception will be\u00a0at\u00a0All-Inclusive hotel called\u00a0DeCameron. \u00a0 I have so far 35 guest and rising lol.\u00a0 Here are some items that I thought about putting in my bags: a Survival Kit with advil, alkaselzer,altoids, gum or mints, motion sickness meds, pepto bismol , hand sanitizer a sticker that reads In Sickness and In Health on the Meds. Luggage tag with a business card from Vista Print inside with our wedding logo\u00a0, a key holder to put around their necks with the same cards from Vista Print reading To have and To Hold your sign and sail card. A bag of popcorn with a label that reads Have you had a Poppin' Good Time? Thanks for sharing our special day ! Our names and the Wedding Date.<\/p> <p> Here\u00a0are \u00a0some wordings that you can use for labels for your survival kit<\/p> <p> Too Much Booze (BC,<\/p> <p> Too Much Sun ( if you want to put some sunscreen lotion or lip balm)<\/p> <p> Too Much Food (pepto, alkerselzer<\/p> <p> Too Much Fun<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I haven't found a bag yet for them so I might just do a gift bag with my colors and ribbons.<\/p> <p> I don't want to spend much on bags 1.50 is the max and I don't see any cheaper.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Any ideas Ladies for OOOT bags?<\/p> <p> I have seen a template for the survival kit on her but I haven't saved it yet.<\/p> <p> Also I wanted to mention with my Bridesmaids I'm only having 2 their bags will be a little diffent.\u00a0 I'm trying to find a straw bag for them and\u00a0add some sunglasses\u00a0,\u00a0Brides Entorouge tank\u00a0shirt and a passport\u00a0wallet.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I hope that this helped .\u00a0 Let's keep in touch so that\u00a0we can compare wedding info for the Carnival Conquest.\u00a0 You can PM me.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hobsonkimsbaby@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"73.177.20.103","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308505539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241314.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":232,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OurSpecialDay1","Id":241314,"Name":"OurSpecialDay1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa8b4a789283f7b30b118056d0adaed6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just booked my wedding for June 19, 2013 on the Carnival Conquest.&amp;nbsp; Please keep me posted on how everything turned out for your wedding.&amp;nbsp; I absolutely love the welcome bag idea.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Congrats&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1643215,"PostDate":1342721522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just booked my wedding for June 19, 2013 on the Carnival Conquest.\u00a0 Please keep me posted on how everything turned out for your wedding.\u00a0 I absolutely love the welcome bag idea.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congrats<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"capriqua@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1342720738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258073.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cgf061913","Id":258073,"Name":"cgf061913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e6ba4fb24870d77f71f8fc89d5a8c9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That is so amazing! &amp;nbsp;There is a photographer doing free New Orleans weddings. &amp;nbsp;She was booked for my wedding date but you might like her! &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.jenniferbryanphoto.com\/blog\/2012\/9\/cruise-wedding-photographer\"&gt;http:\/\/www.jenniferbryanphoto.com\/blog\/2012\/9\/cruise-wedding-photographer&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1661913,"PostDate":1347322372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That is so amazing! \u00a0There is a photographer doing free New Orleans weddings. \u00a0She was booked for my wedding date but you might like her! \u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.jenniferbryanphoto.com\/blog\/2012\/9\/cruise-wedding-photographer' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jenniferb...ng-photographer<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"reffiec@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1347321885,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CantWait13","Id":260211,"Name":"CantWait13","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9cb46168658942fb91564c89f4eb7cf0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am also making welcome bags but I&#039;m making the adult bags very unisex... Kids I&#039;m giving them a lil shovel and bucket instead of a bag full off little goodies and am making my own coloring books n crayon packets&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1715634,"PostDate":1359970224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am also making welcome bags but I'm making the adult bags very unisex... Kids I'm giving them a lil shovel and bucket instead of a bag full off little goodies and am making my own coloring books n crayon packets<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blondi1029@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359843539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265553.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blondi1029","Id":265553,"Name":"blondi1029","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a1239315a14b739cb0662ddd1c93511","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am just looking at cruise weddings now. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am so confused, so I am hoping this site and you ladies help me!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I read above about having the reception at a hotel when in port?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How do I inquire about this??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1716875,"PostDate":1360154843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am just looking at cruise weddings now. \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am so confused, so I am hoping this site and you ladies help me!<\/p> <p> I read above about having the reception at a hotel when in port?<\/p> <p> How do I inquire about this??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"applefortchr@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"165.155.192.123","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1358083392,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264343.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Brook53","Id":264343,"Name":"Brook53","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a2faa22dcb5b469440bf62f30083c76","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]blondi1029[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am also making welcome bags but I&#039;m making the adult bags very unisex... Kids I&#039;m giving them a lil shovel and bucket instead of a bag full off little goodies and am making my own coloring books n crayon packets[\/quote] \n The shovel\/bucket idea is great, I am glad you mentioned it that way the kids will have something to play with on the beach, thanks!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1737903,"PostDate":1364187109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>blondi1029<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am also making welcome bags but I'm making the adult bags very unisex... Kids I'm giving them a lil shovel and bucket instead of a bag full off little goodies and am making my own coloring books n crayon packets<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> The shovel\/bucket idea is great, I am glad you mentioned it that way the kids will have something to play with on the beach, thanks!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mscheryl10@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1361030249,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266139.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mscheryl10","Id":266139,"Name":"mscheryl10","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"64637","Title":"Welcome Aboard Bags????","LastPostDate":1409276972},"Pages":{"TotalItems":18,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
