{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":110512,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nmisbosox has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Moon Palace\".\n\nmisbosox said:\n======================================================================\nJust posted pictures in my gallery of sneak peaks.  \n\"Our moon palace wedding ~ June 23, 2015\"\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10618&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440311875,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10618},{"Id":110476,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nmisbosox has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Moon Palace\".\n\nmisbosox said:\n======================================================================\n@surekha  \nWe used outside vendor - Bicoastal Images with Jennifer and Manuel Salazar. Husband and wife owned and run photography company they are located right in Cancun area and also travel to Toronto, Canada to shoot weddings.  We had both of them shoot our wedding day from 9:30am -9:30pm.   Plus next day we went to a place near Sun Palace to do our TTD (trash the dress) shoot.  Loved them and such a great couple. \nWe got a sneak peek of some of our photos (93 of them).  That is not all of them so excited to see the rest and the TTD ones. \n\nFor video one of our groomsmen owns a video company in Kansas City so we had him film wedding and reception.  Kinda was hard since he was in the wedding too.  He set up prior bunch hidden style cameras, tripod, etc.  plus had small camera with him during everything.  Haven't seen this yet.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10618&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1440268701,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10618},{"Id":105026,"Title":"liked a post you made in Has Anyone Used Www.myweddi...","Message":"Hello!\n\nacw271011 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nTry mywedding.com, you can create a free wedding website and if you download the weddingparty app, you can link this with the website also so all those that have the app and add pictures from your wedding they load onto your website.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79441-has-anyone-used-wwwmyweddingstoryco\/?view=findpost&p=1901439\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1438278117,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":104431,"Title":"replied to Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nWafflesmom (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"acw271011\" we've booked Samuel Luna too! Great minds think alike\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79436-wedding-photo-and-video-packages-help\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQzNjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1438148754,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79436},{"Id":104396,"Title":"replied to Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nacw271011 (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/232000-acw271011\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nWe're using Samuel Luna and I find him pretty reasonable. He has started doing video as well so it would give you just the one vendor for both. I don't know about help with a vendor fee because we don't really have one - we're off site from a resort instead so we're set up a bit differently.\n \nTake a look through the vendor reviews here and see what other brides have said about their experience, then go online and review the photographer's sites. Ask for pricing and what they are ale to give you. Compare pricing and services and if possible, try to find a photographer that speaks to what you want.\n \nGood luck!\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79436-wedding-photo-and-video-packages-help\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQzNjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1438142449,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79436},{"Id":104326,"Title":"replied to Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nSascha Gluck Photography (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/211397-sascha-gluck-photography\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nWelcome to the Forum and happy planning.... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79436-wedding-photo-and-video-packages-help\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQzNjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":211397,"Name":"Sascha Gluck Photography","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211397.png?_r=1433780841","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":124,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438124365,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79436},{"Id":103718,"Title":"replied to Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nMoments That Matter (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/230711-moments-that-matter\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Wedding Photo And Video Packages - Help!\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nWelcome to our forum community, Surekha and Congrats on your upcoming Moon Palace wedding!!!\n \nWe've recently restructured our pricing to be more attractive to wedding couples' spending plans and also offer a vendor discount to help you with the resort fee charged for outside vendors.\n \nYou're certainly on the right track tho - by preferring a professional photographer rather than the one offered by your resort! We always advise our wedding couples to choose a professional if photography is important to them, b\/c they'll be sooooo much happier with the results they get <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \nHope you find the answers you're looking for and right solution to capture all those magical moments that matter on your Special Day!!!\n \nTo show you what an amazing backdrop the Moon Palace makes for your wedding photos, here are some excerpts from some weddings Linc has captured there.......enjoy!\n \n....Moon Palace Wedding Album 1:  (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153122555899487.1073741922.18683524486&type=3)\n \n\n \n...Moon Palace Wedding Album 2: (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153058061334487.1073741919.18683524486&type=3)\n \n\n \n....Moon Palace Wedding Album 3: (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&type=3)\n \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79436-wedding-photo-and-video-packages-help\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQzNjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1438013856,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79436},{"Id":103691,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\ncolleentf09 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"MOON PALACE BRIDES\".\n\ncolleentf09 said:\n======================================================================\nI'm only having photo and its $1600 for 8 hours. That would be great if you could send me the script, my email is colleentf09@yahoo.com. Thanks! Are you doing the legal ceremony or just symbolic? We're having a symbolic ceremony and getting married at home before we go to Mexico.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10720&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437981449,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10720},{"Id":103588,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nmisbosox has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Wedding Moon Palace\".\n\nmisbosox said:\n======================================================================\nI haven't posted my pictures yet.  I will be soon with full review along with them.  I've been so busy traveling after our wedding it's been crazy     \nEverything was amazing at the resort.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10618&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437923417,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10618},{"Id":103546,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\ncolleentf09 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"MOON PALACE BRIDES\".\n\ncolleentf09 said:\n======================================================================\nWe were originally going to have our ceremony on the beach but I think we're going to have it in a gazebo now.  I haven't seen the script yet, I'll have to ask for it again. When I asked about what they would say she just told her I could give her ideas if I wanted anything specific. I'm about to book Ivan Luckie for photography, even with the outside vendor fee he is cheaper than the dreamart packages. Zuniga is probably kind of pricey too but I don't know how much decor we will need. I think we're only having about 20-22 people so don't need many centerpieces. I live in Baltimore Maryland, where are you from?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10720&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437856734,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10720},{"Id":103535,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nMoments That Matter (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/230711-moments-that-matter\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nWelcome to our forum community, Jessie and Congrats on your upcoming dw!!! hope you're able to get the reassurance you're looking for from all the resources here, and all the best with your plans - cheers, team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n \n....here's a few magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at a recent MPG wedding - to show you what a beautiful backdrop it would make for your wedding photos.....from the Moon Palace Grand Wedding Album: (https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153058061334487.1073741919.18683524486&type=3)\n\n\n \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437847507,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":103177,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"JessieL\" no worries! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Just thought i'd let you know that it may actually be for the better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437746894,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":103166,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nOh exciting. Not long then. We're actually going back on 22nd September for a reunion holiday we can't wait!\n\nI made my own bouquets as I make them for a living. I used my bridesmaids bouquets as table centres and got deco to provide the vases for me.\n\nI took my dress on as hand luggage as I didn't want to risk it. The shop where I brought it from boxed it up for me.\n\nI will email you some pictures over x\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437735839,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103164,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/264357-ems85\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nThis information would be helpful for me too, my wedding is in Ocrober.\nWe have now been moved to the Venado Terrace as the Caribbean Terrace is closing due to refurbishment works <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\nThe lighting is so expensive, we liked the lanterns and string lights but the need to put up structures plus the lights so will work out over budget for me too.\nAny tips or ideas would be much appreciated.\n \nx\n-----------------------------\n\nJust to let you know they don't need to put up structures for the lanterns as they use the lamp posts which are already there to attach them to. \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437734203,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":103163,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nSorry I forgot to say yes there was a bar and this was included in the basic package x\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437733709,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103162,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nI live just outside of London. I remember worrying about the same things. I just wanted it to be perfect and it was as will yours be. \n\nWith regards to the lanterns they are actually lights so you can provide the lanterns and they will attach these on to the lights for you. They look so effective once the sun starts to set.\nYou can get them on eBay pretty cheap. I actually ordreed mine from the states as I wanted parasols which matched the colours of the bridesmaids dresses. They were really reasonable but the postage charge was the same amount as the actual order.\nI think about 24 lanterns covered the area I wanted. We did have a separate bamboo structure which had about 12 lanterns hanging down which looked really effective to. \n\nWe didn't have a DJ as I knew what songs I wanted to be played so I hired the IPod dock with speakers and lights. With this they had a guy sitting there all night operating it. But as I did a playlist he didn't have to do much. \n\nI didn't upgrade the cake but I provided my own cake topper for it so it looked really nice. We had the cheesecake option And everybody said it was amazing.\n\nThe day after we arrived we had our blood tests and then we had the meeting with our coordinator. We were there 2 weeks before the wedding so we could chill out before the big event. I think we pretty much had everything sorted before the meeting but they go over all the details where you can add and change things.\n\nIf you would like me to send you some photos let me know.\nWhat date is your wedding?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437733660,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103158,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nDon't worry about asking too many questions. Ask away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n\nEverything I brought myself (including lanterns) I gave to my wedding co ordinatior with instructions of what I would like done with them. I wasnt charged any extra for this as there was already a set up and delivery fee of $150.\nThey hung all the lanterns for me. They did a fab job. It made it so much cheaper providing my own lanterns. I also provided my own table runners which they were happy to set up for me. \n\nThe terrace was perfect. I originally wanted the roof top terrace on the grand side. However there were lots of extra charges as it was upstairs and they said anybody could come up and use the bar during the reception which I wasn't so keen on. The terrace ended up being the most perfect place. \nOur wedding was at 3pm which in my view was perfect. Everything ran so smoothly from there. I missed the entire cocktail hour as we were having photos taken during this time.\nWe used the hotel photographer who was fab. We payed around $2000 for our package which included a couple of hours of video. To be honest I wish we had just gone all out and had the entire day filmed as they are moments you can never get back. I've seen outside vendors can do an amazing job but they cost quite a bit more. I'd say if you are happy with their portfolio I'm sure they will do an amazing job and be worth every penny. \n\nIf you need any more advice let me know xx\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437727917,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":103152,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nJessieL (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283575-jessiel\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nThanks@\"perianjay\"!\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":283575,"Name":"JessieL","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437719109,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":102986,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nLeoMax (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284049-leomax\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n------------ QUOTE ----------\nCaribbean Terrace is closing due to refurbishment works <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\n-----------------------------\n\nThat's too bad. I was supposed to attend a wedding there in a few weeks. I guess that I will get a call about venue change soon.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":284049,"Name":"LeoMax","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284049.png?_r=1437433269","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437682694,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102972,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nEms85 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Moon Palace Bride to Be\".\n\nEms85 said:\n======================================================================\nHello\n\nLovely to hear from you. Deco Cancun did our decor for us. This is a break down of what we had.\nHere's the breakdown of what we had;\n\nDraping for the Chapel ( see below pictures) - $350\nWicker Lounge set up for 8-10 people $135x 2 - $270\nLantern Structure - $125 (I provided my own lanterns as this was cheaper)\nString of 10 lanterns $75 x 3 - $225 ( my own lanterns)\nCandy Table with Candy for 30ppl - $ 330 \nLight trees for around the terrace $35 x4 $140\nGlass vases with surrounding candles and mirror base $15 x5 $75 \nDelivery and set up $150\n\nI provided a lot of my own things as it worked out cheaper. Plus I wanted to colour match things. If you need any help or advice you are welcome to email me emilykate.field@hotmail.co.uk\nI'd be happy to help. I loved planning my wedding so much. Savour every moment as it goes so quickly.\n\nHope that helped a bit\n\nEmily xx\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10752&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437680686,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10752},{"Id":102923,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=findpost&p=1901029\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" unless they've changed this recently, there are three palace approved vendors for decor: Gama, zuniga and LatinAsia\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1437670267,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102922,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nWafflesmom (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" unless they've changed this recently, there are three palace approved vendors for decor: Gama, zuniga and LatinAsia\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1437670267,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102919,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Grand Closed For Remodeling?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"JessieL\" I am not able to confirm this, but I did stay at the Moon Palace Grand when I was there. Honestly, I actually would've preferred a different section of the resort (just personal preference) because MPG is off to the side and it's pretty remote and tucked away from the rest of the resort. All of the good restaurants and attractions are in the main area of the building which you would have to take a shuttle to constantly. My fiance and I spent more time taking shuttles to other parts of the resort, than we did lingering around the MPG area. \n \nIt's a very beautiful area of the resort, but my one complaint would've been that it really is so remote and you do feel so far away from all of the action and fun at the resort.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79285-moon-palace-grand-closed-for-remodeling\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTI4NTsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437669359,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79285},{"Id":102918,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=findpost&p=1901024\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" Moon Palace is MASSIVE and there are SOO many perfect spots there to have your wedding. I know It's probably a disappointment to have to move terraces, but I think once you see the other options in person you will be really happy with them. I've stayed at the resort myself and the grounds are lovely no matter what section you're in.\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437668485,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102917,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Bride To Be - Tips And Ideas Please\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"SUREKHA\" Moon Palace is MASSIVE and there are SOO many perfect spots there to have your wedding. I know It's probably a disappointment to have to move terraces, but I think once you see the other options in person you will be really happy with them. I've stayed at the resort myself and the grounds are lovely no matter what section you're in.\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTM5NjsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437668485,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79396},{"Id":102907,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nperianjay (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281478-perianjay\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n@\"Wafflesmom\" is totally right. I went through Zuniga as a vendor and they had these arched bamboo poles that have two chinese lanterns hanging from them. I can't remember the exact price off the top of my head.. but it was a lot less and it required no poles to be installed. I basically have one beside each guest table (3 tables) and I have 4 of them to frame the \"dance floor\" area in the shape of a square. I rented a  hanging chandelier for above the head table. The chandeliers are quite a bit more than the bamboo poles which is why I am only renting one.\n \nLighting is definitely a necessity in most cases. I know that at Beach Palace, almost every single terrace they have available for the reception has no lighting. I felt super stressed about lighting when I first started planning, but now i'm happy I found a cheaper option. The string lights (for three strings + tensors) would've cost me $1000 USD if I did them. Lighting is now costing me half of that (including the chandelier). \n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437667602,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102888,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that Wafflesmom mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=findpost&p=1901017\n\n----------------------------------\nHi @\"SUREKHA\" I'm so sorry to hear that they've had to change your reception venue on you. I know it can be quite disappointing, especially if you've already had a vision of what your day will look like.\n\nI've seen some photos of the Venado terrace on this forum and it was beautiful! Based on your post, did you say there's no structure to hang lights? If that's the case, there are lots of other options. @\"perianjay\" ran into this same problem and is now using the lanterns on bamboo fixtures. There's also hanging chandeliers if you prefer. Or you can always get the lighting options from a DJ if you choose to have one. Another idea may be to do the under table lights, and have a light up dance floor. You have plenty of options <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1437665188,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102886,"Title":"replied to Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\nWafflesmom (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/279721-wafflesmom\/) has just posted a reply to a topic that you have subscribed to titled \"Moon Palace Terrace Lighting?\".\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nHi @\"SUREKHA\" I'm so sorry to hear that they've had to change your reception venue on you. I know it can be quite disappointing, especially if you've already had a vision of what your day will look like.\n\nI've seen some photos of the Venado terrace on this forum and it was beautiful! Based on your post, did you say there's no structure to hang lights? If that's the case, there are lots of other options. @\"perianjay\" ran into this same problem and is now using the lanterns on bamboo fixtures. There's also hanging chandeliers if you prefer. Or you can always get the lighting options from a DJ if you choose to have one. Another idea may be to do the under table lights, and have a light up dance floor. You have plenty of options <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nThe topic can be found here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79424-moon-palace-terrace-lighting\/?view=getnewpost\n\nIf you have configured in your control panel to receive immediate topic reply notifications, you may receive an\nemail for each reply made to this topic.  Otherwise, only 1 email is sent per board visit for each subscribed topic. \nThis is to limit the amount of mail that is sent to your inbox.\n\nYou can unsubscribe at any time here: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/unsubscribe\/Zm9ydW1zO3RvcGljczs3OTQyNDsyODM5Mzc7MjgzOTM3O3N1cmVraGFfMThAaG90bWFpbC5jb20,\/\n","Sender":{"Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1441055220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1437665188,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Topic","RelatedItemId":79424},{"Id":102851,"Title":"liked a post you made in Moon Palace Bride To Be - T...","Message":"Hello!\n\nChris126 just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nMy wedding here is booked now!I had read so many good reviews and a few bad \ud83d\ude16 the good seem to weigh out over the bad.I think the hotel itself will be amazing and the wedding planners at the hotel seem to be really good at what they do.\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79396-moon-palace-bride-to-be-tips-and-ideas-please\/?view=findpost&p=1900899\n","Sender":{"Id":284060,"Name":"Chris126","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437657189,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":102845,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"SUREKHA,\n\ncolleentf09 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"MOON PALACE BRIDES\".\n\ncolleentf09 said:\n======================================================================\nI feel the same way, I know there's probably a lot more to do than I'm realizing right now. I'm working with Lizet right now, do you know when we switch to the coordinator that is actually at the resort? \nWe just choose the complimentary package. I'm trying to figure out easy centerpieces that won't be crazy expensive. I haven't gotten any quotes yet on decor but I think I've only been given the brochure for Zuniga. I wonder if the prices are similar to grupo gams? \n\nI didn't know there was going to be work done to the grand section. I only know about it from people posting on here. My coordinator or travel agent haven't said anything and we even visited the resort in May and no one told us.\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=10720&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1437651680,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10720}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"33","TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
