{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":19355,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437559518,"Content":"Hi how are you?<br \/>\nOur wedding is also in October this year.<br \/>\nHow is your planning going?  Have you got most things finalized now?<br \/>\n<br \/>\nSurekha","PostKey":"eba6e94653fb58f08ccfd1cffe861ba7","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19396,"Author":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437640536,"Content":"Planning is going alright, I've been slacking a little until recently! The biggest things are deciding on a menu and figuring out what to do for decor\/centerpieces. I'm still waiting on an email back from my coordinator from almost a week ago [emoji53] How's your planning going? ","PostKey":"5d60dcf2ca58731b424c193a7af8adc5","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19397,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437641584,"Content":"Same slacking a little too! Feels like there isn't much to do but then when I think about it properly seems like so much to do \ud83d\ude01<br>\nI am working with Alejandra just now,she is quite slow in replying sometimes.<br>\nI just got an email from her yesterday to say that the Caribbean terrace is now going to be closed because of the grand refurbishment work and that our reception has been moved to the venado terrace.<br>\nQuite disappointed to be honest as since we booked the roof top terrace I have started to visualize how it would all look with my decor. Seems like I am back to the start again with planning how I want it to look.<br><br>\nWhich wedding package did u choose. We have gone with pearl shimmer.<br><br>\nHave u chosen menus yet,I think we want to go with a plated dinner service so many options to choose from!!<br><br>\nThe centrepieces with grupo gams are so expensive she quoted $38 dollars for one vase piece with no mirror base. And $120 for a set of 4 vases for each table.  have you had any quotes for decor?<br><br>\nSurekha","PostKey":"db096f050489da89c0b2e9fb5e1e383a","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19398,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437641701,"Content":"Same slacking a little too! Feels like there isn't much to do but then when I think about it properly seems like so much to do \ud83d\ude01<br>\nI am working with Alejandra just now,she is quite slow in replying sometimes.<br>\nI just got an email from her yesterday to say that the Caribbean terrace is now going to be closed because of the grand refurbishment work and that our reception has been moved to the venado terrace.<br>\nQuite disappointed to be honest as since we booked the roof top terrace I have started to visualize how it would all look with my decor. Seems like I am back to the start again with planning how I want it to look.<br><br>\nWhich wedding package did u choose. We have gone with pearl shimmer.<br><br>\nHave u chosen menus yet,I think we want to go with a plated dinner service so many options to choose from!!<br><br>\nThe centrepieces with grupo gams are so expensive she quoted $38 dollars for one vase piece with no mirror base. And $120 for a set of 4 vases for each table.  have you had any quotes for decor?<br><br>\nSurekha","PostKey":"1e0b107158d3118107c572a0baf6cef5","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19399,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437641872,"Content":"Did u know about the works to the grand when u booked ur wedding?<br>\nWe found out after, I wasn't too happy, my travel agent wouldn't give any refund but said they could change the hotel but it was too late to make those kind of changes plus changing all our guests.","PostKey":"ea414f68edd5f4b4716a070fdad710f9","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19404,"Author":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437651680,"Content":"I feel the same way, I know there's probably a lot more to do than I'm realizing right now. I'm working with Lizet right now, do you know when we switch to the coordinator that is actually at the resort? <br>\nWe just choose the complimentary package. I'm trying to figure out easy centerpieces that won't be crazy expensive. I haven't gotten any quotes yet on decor but I think I've only been given the brochure for Zuniga. I wonder if the prices are similar to grupo gams? <br><br>\nI didn't know there was going to be work done to the grand section. I only know about it from people posting on here. My coordinator or travel agent haven't said anything and we even visited the resort in May and no one told us. ","PostKey":"6dd3363e1847956c6bf57adccff520b3","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19406,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437656841,"Content":"<p>I am not sure when we switch, I wasnt even aware of this until reading forums on here. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Where is your wedding ceremony?<\/p>\n<p>I got the wedding script yesterday, nice wording in it.<\/p>\n<p>Have you booked photo and video? \u00a0We went with Dreamart, although still to confirm and pay deposits, wanted Del Sol but they dont do video and would have been too expensive with the outside vendor fee to have both external.<\/p>\n<p>What are zunigas prices like for wedding decor? \u00a0Grupo Gama seem quite pricey. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Surekha<\/p>\n","PostKey":"526401c5f8fd80761fc0dd5416d95a78","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19407,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437656856,"Content":"<p>Where are you from? x<\/p>\n","PostKey":"6c5d124068f7e6b9aaa43c050e3364fb","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19476,"Author":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437856734,"Content":"We were originally going to have our ceremony on the beach but I think we're going to have it in a gazebo now.  I haven't seen the script yet, I'll have to ask for it again. When I asked about what they would say she just told her I could give her ideas if I wanted anything specific. I'm about to book Ivan Luckie for photography, even with the outside vendor fee he is cheaper than the dreamart packages. Zuniga is probably kind of pricey too but I don't know how much decor we will need. I think we're only having about 20-22 people so don't need many centerpieces. I live in Baltimore Maryland, where are you from?","PostKey":"314f08691056027d7a4a47089e2a58cd","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19477,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437864803,"Content":"Are you having photo and video?<br>\nDreamart quoted us $4400 for 5hiurs photo and 4hours video. <br>\nI got the script emailed to me the other day I can send it to you if you like?<br><br>\nI am from Scotland x","PostKey":"1e5e0c20f9f25acb6cce4e76e09e9cef","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19513,"Author":{"Id":280885,"Name":"colleentf09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280885.jpg?_r=1414462566","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437981449,"Content":"I'm only having photo and its $1600 for 8 hours. That would be great if you could send me the script, my email is colleentf09@yahoo.com. Thanks! Are you doing the legal ceremony or just symbolic? We're having a symbolic ceremony and getting married at home before we go to Mexico. ","PostKey":"c2aa1fd927712ebff6edfa83fbd91c4f","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
