Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":19409,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437660202,"Content":"Hi<br \/>\nI am getting married in Moon Palace this October.<br \/>\nYour wedding set up was beautiful.<br \/>\nWho did you arrange to do the reception decor, its really nice.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nSurekha","PostKey":"d2f38cfb4ff69836afdc380558500b52","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19418,"Author":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437680686,"Content":"Hello<br><br>\nLovely to hear from you. Deco Cancun did our decor for us. This is a break down of what we had.<br>\nHere's the breakdown of what we had;<br><br>\nDraping for the Chapel ( see below pictures) - $350<br>\nWicker Lounge set up for 8-10 people $135x 2 - $270<br>\nLantern Structure - $125 (I provided my own lanterns as this was cheaper)<br>\nString of 10 lanterns $75 x 3 - $225 ( my own lanterns)<br>\nCandy Table with Candy for 30ppl - $ 330 <br>\nLight trees for around the terrace $35 x4 $140<br>\nGlass vases with surrounding candles and mirror base $15 x5 $75 <br>\nDelivery and set up $150<br><br>\nI provided a lot of my own things as it worked out cheaper. Plus I wanted to colour match things. If you need any help or advice you are welcome to email me emilykate.field@hotmail.co.uk<br>\nI'd be happy to help. I loved planning my wedding so much. Savour every moment as it goes so quickly.<br><br>\nHope that helped a bit<br><br>\nEmily xx","PostKey":"d5049c0ea34f57e20c292f9d9ef948c8","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19422,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437689680,"Content":"The lanterns are a lovely. <br>\nDid u buy the lanterns and put these on string yourself? Did you have to hang them up yourself?<br><br>\nDid deco cancun charge fees to set up?<br><br>\nWas the terrace windy?<br><br>\nHow did you arrange your photography and video to capture all of the special moments. We have chosen dreamart the hotels preferred vendor. Our wedding is at 3pm, cocktail hour after this then reception about 5pm. <br>\nDreamart suggested 5hours photo and 4 hours video. Do you think this is too much or enough? They are charging $4400 is this reasonable from experience?<br><br>\nSorry to send you so many questions!<br><br>\nThanks in advance<br><br>\nSurekha ","PostKey":"7bf30035026d34a616e2f9e9fc30255b","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19435,"Author":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437727917,"Content":"Don't worry about asking too many questions. Ask away <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nEverything I brought myself (including lanterns) I gave to my wedding co ordinatior with instructions of what I would like done with them. I wasnt charged any extra for this as there was already a set up and delivery fee of $150.<br>\nThey hung all the lanterns for me. They did a fab job. It made it so much cheaper providing my own lanterns. I also provided my own table runners which they were happy to set up for me. <br><br>\nThe terrace was perfect. I originally wanted the roof top terrace on the grand side. However there were lots of extra charges as it was upstairs and they said anybody could come up and use the bar during the reception which I wasn't so keen on. The terrace ended up being the most perfect place. <br>\nOur wedding was at 3pm which in my view was perfect. Everything ran so smoothly from there. I missed the entire cocktail hour as we were having photos taken during this time.<br>\nWe used the hotel photographer who was fab. We payed around $2000 for our package which included a couple of hours of video. To be honest I wish we had just gone all out and had the entire day filmed as they are moments you can never get back. I've seen outside vendors can do an amazing job but they cost quite a bit more. I'd say if you are happy with their portfolio I'm sure they will do an amazing job and be worth every penny. <br><br>\nIf you need any more advice let me know xx","PostKey":"6e676a9853e7aa45716036f1708cfd99","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19436,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437730690,"Content":"<p>Hi<\/p>\n<p>Thank you this is great, hearing it from someone thats done it already. \u00a0Where are you from? \u00a0I am from Scotland.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I saw the lanterns on ebay, might order a few with some type of string and see what they can do. \u00a0 How many roughly did you need to cover the terrace?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I saw nice table runners and will get these myself as theirs are quite expensive and not what I wanted. \u00a0I wanted something with a bit of sparkle.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think I will just go with the photgraphy package I have picked, its costly, but like you say dont want to have regrets. \u00a0I would love for them to film the getting ready, wedding, entrance to reception, first dance cake, speeches and maybe the first bit of the party so hopefully that will cover it. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I chose Discomovil Cancun for my DJ as he was much cheaper than JSAV even with the vendor fee. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you upgrade your cake, how much to do this?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Was there a bar at your reception, did you need to pay for this to be set up?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also whats the procedure for planning etc when you arrive in resort, we arrive on the Saturday but our wedding isnt until 10 days later, this was to allow people to come for 1week. \u00a0Can you add and change things like decor at that meeting or do you need to do it all before?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Surekha x<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"823063554d7641226e612e849f8f9aef","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19438,"Author":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437733660,"Content":"I live just outside of London. I remember worrying about the same things. I just wanted it to be perfect and it was as will yours be. <br><br>\nWith regards to the lanterns they are actually lights so you can provide the lanterns and they will attach these on to the lights for you. They look so effective once the sun starts to set.<br>\nYou can get them on eBay pretty cheap. I actually ordreed mine from the states as I wanted parasols which matched the colours of the bridesmaids dresses. They were really reasonable but the postage charge was the same amount as the actual order.<br>\nI think about 24 lanterns covered the area I wanted. We did have a separate bamboo structure which had about 12 lanterns hanging down which looked really effective to. <br><br>\nWe didn't have a DJ as I knew what songs I wanted to be played so I hired the IPod dock with speakers and lights. With this they had a guy sitting there all night operating it. But as I did a playlist he didn't have to do much. <br><br>\nI didn't upgrade the cake but I provided my own cake topper for it so it looked really nice. We had the cheesecake option And everybody said it was amazing.<br><br>\nThe day after we arrived we had our blood tests and then we had the meeting with our coordinator. We were there 2 weeks before the wedding so we could chill out before the big event. I think we pretty much had everything sorted before the meeting but they go over all the details where you can add and change things.<br><br>\nIf you would like me to send you some photos let me know.<br>\nWhat date is your wedding? ","PostKey":"d41d116236f4738d8fcb20dfb98920e1","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19439,"Author":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437733709,"Content":"Sorry I forgot to say yes there was a bar and this was included in the basic package x","PostKey":"0d7a3006899327d48e02380479774d9a","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19440,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437734510,"Content":"<p>I know I am getting quite nervous now that its getting so close. \u00a0I get married on 7th October.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you could send pics that would be great. \u00a0My email address is surekha_18@hotmail.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you say you put your own flowers into vases for your centre pieces? \u00a0Did you get them from deco cancun too? \u00a0I was considering trying to find a walmart or something to buy these when there and take my own too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Did you put your dress in a case or a dress bag? \u00a0And did you take this on as hand luggage?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Surekha<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"c8d158627cb8cb4a3808d8a5a00e701b","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19441,"Author":{"Id":264357,"Name":"Ems85","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264357.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1437735839,"Content":"Oh exciting. Not long then. We're actually going back on 22nd September for a reunion holiday we can't wait!<br><br>\nI made my own bouquets as I make them for a living. I used my bridesmaids bouquets as table centres and got deco to provide the vases for me.<br><br>\nI took my dress on as hand luggage as I didn't want to risk it. The shop where I brought it from boxed it up for me.<br><br>\nI will email you some pictures over x ","PostKey":"2aae6728973f1209d5c863dc37fc224f","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19442,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1437736906,"Content":"<p>I might see you there, we arrive on 26 Sept and are there until 10th.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My friend is making my bouquet as gift, do you have a website though incase I dont like it and need to buy one lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks I will message you when i have had a look at the pics x<\/p>\n","PostKey":"414dbd6e3a6f79b119f3ce359c2eb0b0","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":19662,"Author":{"Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1438618643,"Content":"<p>Hi your pics were beautiful!<\/p>\n<p>Spoke to Alejandra at Moon Palace to have a chat over our final plans, final balances all to be paid soon so will start to seem more real.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n","PostKey":"8ccaf18e7f017e786c8c8e07ba220d40","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
